---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title={`Privacy Policy | ${site.name}`} description="Privacy information for Ark Coffee & Eatery reservation inquiries and website contact.">
  <main class="page-shell min-h-screen py-16">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="display-heading mt-3 text-4xl text-ark-brown md:text-5xl">Reservation privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-stone-700">
        Ark Coffee &amp; Eatery uses WhatsApp for reservation inquiries. A submitted WhatsApp conversation may contain your name,
        phone number, preferred date and time, party size, and order details. The local reservation prototype is available only in development,
        uses synthetic test data in temporary memory, and sends nothing to the café.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-ark-brown">What we collect</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-stone-700">
        We collect only the reservation and contact information that you choose to send to the café through WhatsApp.
        The public static website does not store reservation data, accept payment, or verify transfers. No payment gateway is connected.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-ark-brown">How it is used</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-stone-700">
        Information is used to review the requested date, time, party size, and pre-order and to manually verify full payment.
        A pre-order of at least Rp 250,000 per reservation is required; prices include tax. Customer cancellations and no-shows after
        1 hour without contact forfeit payment. If the café cannot fulfill the reservation or order, payment is refunded in full.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-ark-brown">Retention and deletion</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-stone-700">
        Reservation inquiries are retained for 12 months. The local prototype stores data only in temporary memory; restarting its local server erases it.
        To request correction or deletion of reservation information,
        contact <a class="underline" href={`mailto:${site.privacyContact}`}>{site.privacyContact}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-ark-brown">Your choices</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8 text-stone-700">
        Send payment proof through WhatsApp only after placing a reservation request. Staff review availability and payment manually within 30 minutes
        after proof is received. A reservation is not confirmed until staff confirms it. No payment or refund is processed automatically by this website.
      </p>

      <a
        class="mt-10 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-ark-brown/20 bg-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-ark-brown"
        href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>Back to website</a
      >
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
